",\"response\":\"**Decision:** Do not rerun the earlier response command. The durable leaf receipt proves the comment was written; replay risks a duplicate. The reviewer\u2019s edit also invalidates the earlier semantic epoch.\\n\\n**Next actions:**\\n\\n1. Preserve the surviving receipt for `migration-101`, including:\\n   - IssueComment identity `IC_result201`\\n   - exact request/body binding\\n   - exact post-write reread\\n   - original epoch and source revision\\n2. Record the failed Response Outcome Bundle append and the volume-full error without weakening the successful write evidence.\\n3. Restore storage capacity without deleting the receipt.\\n4. Reconstruct and append the missing outcome from the receipt\u2014do not invoke the write actuator again.\\n5. Record the reviewer\u2019s edited source as a new revision and explicitly mark the earlier semantic assessment stale.\\n6. Reassess the persisted response against the edited feedback. If further communication is needed, create a new intent and response rather than replaying `migration-101`.\\n7. Mark the batch addressed only after every item has a durable, current-revision outcome.\\n\\n**Draft status:**\\n\\n> I won\u2019t rerun the earlier response. `IC_result201` was durably written and reread, so replaying it could duplicate the comment. I\u2019ll recover the missing semantic record from that receipt, preserve the storage-failure evidence, and reassess the reviewer\u2019s edited source in a new epoch. The feedback batch remains open until that current-revision assessment is durably recorded.\\n\\n**Stopping state:** No command has been rerun, and the batch is not marked addressed. The durable comment stands; semantic persistence and current-source qualification remain incomplete.\",\"response_sha256\":\"0d9b8fb8419282e0eed7873e3e974afb0b9c87bdbf4b0cd598409805999fe536\"}",
