",\"response\":\"**Decision:** Do not rerun `migration-101`. Receipt `IC_result201` proves the response was written and reread; rerunning risks a duplicate. The later source edit makes the earlier semantic assessment stale, not the write unsuccessful.\\n\\n**Next actions:**\\n\\n1. Preserve the leaf receipt unchanged.\\n2. Restore local persistence capacity.\\n3. Re-read the reviewer\u2019s current source and reassess the response against that revision.\\n4. Append a recovered Response Outcome Bundle linking:\\n   - intent `migration-101`;\\n   - IssueComment `IC_result201`;\\n   - exact request/body binding and reread evidence;\\n   - the source revision answered;\\n   - the subsequent source edit;\\n   - the failed append and recovery.\\n5. If the edit requires another response, issue it under a new intent. Never reuse `migration-101`.\\n6. Mark the batch addressed only after every item has current, durably persisted completion evidence.\\n\\n**Draft response:**\\n\\n> I won\u2019t rerun `migration-101`. Its surviving receipt proves that `IC_result201` was published and reread successfully. I\u2019ll recover semantic persistence, reassess the reviewer\u2019s edited source, and record the outcome against both revisions. The full batch remains unaddressed until that recovery and current-source verification are durable.\\n\\n**Stopping state:** No command has been rerun, and the batch is not marked addressed. The verified leaf receipt remains authoritative for the completed write; current semantic completion remains pending.\",\"response_sha256\":\"6fac1274887a98aa7ae25f4c4abd6e10fc8d00550900c067767a4f2460228025\"}",
