ing was forwarded.\\n- **Evidence chain:** No attempt, provider result, response identity, reread, leaf receipt, or outcome exists. Each is required independently.\\n- **Status:** Proposed and not executed. The response may proceed only after admission and successful revalidation.\\n\\n### Intent handoff \u2014 PullRequestReview `PRR_82`\\n\\n- **Intent:** Proposed; key `absent\u2014not yet admitted`.\\n- **Binding:** `example/widgets` PR 418; supplied revision of PullRequestReview `PRR_82`, database ID 82; head `1111111111111111111111111111111111111111`; `pr_conversation_response` in the PR conversation.\\n- **Decision and policy:** Separate response authorized and adjudicated; exact evidence identifiers must enter the admitted intent. Ambient client policy selected; review-voice projection unavailable. Policy affects wording only.\\n- **Pre-write revalidation:** Not run; required immediately before any future write.\\n- **Writer bytes:** Candidate above uses UTF-8 and no terminal newline. Writer identity and digest are not yet bound; nothing was forwarded.\\n- **Evidence chain:** No attempt, provider result, response identity, reread, leaf receipt, or outcome exists. Each is required independently.\\n- **Status:** Proposed and not executed. The unrelated inline comments remain outside this response scope; neither response would establish that all feedback is addressed.\",\"response_sha256\":\"8d7756ff72cd2c395d586191ceb308ffa4ebbd496526aaa5f893e2271947ed00\"}",
